  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%84%98%EC%B9%98%EC%A7%80%EB%8F%84-%EB%A7%88%EB%A5%B4%EC%A7%80%EB%8F%84-%EC%95%8A%EB%8A%94/3213), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60976725)\n\nSeo Ji-ho, who grew up in a remarried family with a strict atmosphere, was immersed in his studies. One day, Kang Si-joon, a transfer student who stole the first prize from him, finds himself standing in front of Seo Ji-ho's painting for a long time.\n\n“You draw so well? I want to see more of your drawings.”\n\nWith a word from Kang Si-jun, who was an awkward existence itself, Seo Ji-ho dreams of becoming a painter again, and without realizing it, his eyes keep going to Kang Si-jun. Kang Si-jun disappeared the moment he realized that it was his first love.\n\nWe met and broke up during our wandering youth, when we were confused and clumsy, but at that time when we shined the most.\n\nWhat kind of adults can Seo Ji-ho and Kang Si-jun become and what kind of love can they have?",
